Root-cause trace, minimize/restore phase, temporary [VKDBG] instrumentation.
Windows around the first two VUID-vkQueuePresentKHR-pWaitSemaphores-03268 pairs.
The failing present is always the one whose present1 returned -1000208000
(VK_ERROR_PRESENT_TIMING_QUEUE_FULL_EXT) and was then retried on the same
wait semaphore. img=0 throughout, so RenderFinished[] is a single semaphore.

